:: flag.JesseMemory [flag]
{=

(metadata:
"id", [A Pleasant Memory of Jesse],
"type", (a: "att"),
"desc", [How old is she? Four? Five? Even if she is twelve or twenty, she is still a baby to you.],
"tip", [Some comfort for your nightly travels.],
"gainText", [You //should// feel happier, and yet, there is only emptiness. Nonetheless, you hold onto the memory.],
"lossText", [The more you think about her, the more she fades away. She is bound for better places than your mind. But while she remains, other troubling thoughts are quieted.],
)